      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "125+ unique powers : Each with distinct effects, proc rates, and scaling. Choose which powers define your build at key level milestones, then amplify one to Signature status, and unlock Mastery bonuses that permanently deepen your chosen style.",
